She's dead now, so the story can be told, of how
a Valk stepped onto Medusa's level, saw gremlins
multiplying, and remultiplying, went back up with
her flock of pets to the level above, abandoned
them there, and went back down to watch the gremlins
shred each other into gremlin-flavored kibble bits,
multiply, shred, multiply, shred -- worth a free
drink for the story and a couple giggles on hearing
it in any DemiGod's Bar.

Even working down at level 24-26 of the dungeon,
she was still just an XPL 12 character, so she never
got that promised chance to go on a quest.

How did it end for her?  Per the "S" in YASD; digging
down to come back up on the far side of Medusa's level
is only useful if you get back alive, rather than
falling through a series of trapdoors that eventually
leaves all those buffed up pets behind.

Sigh. But it was a good run while it lasted, made #3
on my personal high score table.

